<title>UK: Abbey National sets $500 mln subordinated Yankee.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets $500 mln subordinated Yankee.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abbey National Plc has launched a $500 million subordinated perpetual Yankee bond priced to yield 78 basis points over 10-year U.S. Treasuries, lead manager Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p>There is a call at par after 10 years. The deal was launched on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
